========================================================================================================================
  footing canonical  a_0(0) = 9.360e-11:  SPARC +0.10 dex, RC100 +0.17 dex, MSA-3D +0.57 dex
  footing alt        a_0(0) = 1.130e-10:  SPARC +0.02 dex, RC100 +0.09 dex, MSA-3D +0.49 dex
